          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-10 mb-4">Zoned support</h3>

          <p>
            Zoned coils are softer under the shoulders and firmer under the hips. Helix and Leesa both list zoned lumbar support, though zoning never replaces picking the right overall firmness.
          </p>

          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-10 mb-4">What a mattress cannot do</h3>

          <p>
            A better mattress can ease pressure on sore joints. It does not treat arthritis, and persistent pain warrants a doctor or physical therapist. See our guide to mattresses for back pain and the <a href="/best-mattress-for-side-sleepers/" class="text-[#1E90FF] font-bold no-underline hover:underline">side sleeper guide</a> for more.
