            <p class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Start at medium, then adjust with the trial.</p>
            <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed m-0">If a supportive mattress still feels hard on the shoulders after a few weeks, a 2 to 3 inch topper is cheaper than a new bed.</p>
