        <div id="mistakes" class="scroll-mt-24 mt-16">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-6">
            11. Common Mistakes to Avoid
          </h2>

          <div class="space-y-6 my-8">
            <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Choosing the softest bed for sore joints</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">
                Very soft mattresses feel kind in the showroom, but the hips sink, the spine twists and the edge collapses. For most seniors with joint pain, medium or medium-firm on a hybrid cushions pressure points while still letting you move and stand. Add a topper later if it feels too firm.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Ignoring total bed height</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">
                A new mattress can change your sitting height by several inches. Measure the frame, foundation and mattress together, and compare it with a chair you can stand from easily. Too low makes standing hard; too high leaves feet dangling, which is a fall risk at night.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Buying deep memory foam for someone with limited mobility</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">
                Thick slow memory foam holds the body in place, so turning over and sitting up take real effort. Owners with hip or knee problems commonly report feeling stuck. If mobility is limited, choose a hybrid with a responsive top layer or a gel grid instead.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Assuming the brand trial covers an Amazon order</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">
                Some brands limit trials to direct purchases, and Amazon listings can show different trial lengths from the maker's own site. Tempur-Pedic, for example, applies its 90-night trial only to direct orders. Check who the seller is and read the return terms on the listing before you click buy.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Skipping the edge test during the trial</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">
                Sitting on the edge is the moment a weak mattress fails. In the first week, sit on the edge for a full minute, then stand up without using your hands if you safely can. If your hips sink below your knees, the edge is too soft for you.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

