          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            For most seniors, the right mattress is a medium to medium-firm hybrid at 12 to 14 inches with reinforced edges and a top layer that pushes back. The Helix Midnight Luxe gets all of that right. The Leesa Sapira Chill is the pick for a bed that sits too low, the Brooklyn Signature Hybrid saves money, and the Purple Restore is the easiest to move on.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
